  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till FN och den liberianska regeringens gemensamma program mot sexuellt k&#xf6;nsrelaterat v&#xe5;ld (UN and Liberian Government Joint Programme on Prevention and Response to Sexual Gender Based Violence, JP-SGBV). Programmet syftar bland annat till utveckling av r&#xe4;ttsystemet, f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndrade attityder i samh&#xe4;llet, st&#xf6;d till utsattsa kvinnor och barn och till Ministry of Gender and Development.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the UN and Liberian Government Joint Programme on Prevention and Response to Sexual Gender Based Violence (JP-SGBV). The JP-SGBV entails support that address attitude and behavioural changes, legal and instutional development and strengthening of the Ministry of Gender and Development.</narrative>
  </description>
